  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JRC support to the EU Flagship Initiative on Sustainable Cocoa, in C&#xf4;te d&#xbf;Ivoire Ghana and Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will help operationalise the recently launched multistakeholders dialogue on sustainable cocoa and provide assistance to local stakeholders with the view to (i) strengthen the institutional, legal and regulatory frameworks and (ii) empower the private sector to improve agricultural practices and comply with sustainability standards.</narrative>
